join smallfoot right
Kai: (On the Phone) Sorry someone just stepped into my office.
Kai: What brings you in today?
smallfoot:  I have incredibly small feet.
Kai: And how does that make you feel?
smallfoot:  It makes me feel so ugly. I feel like I have to hide them all the time.
Kai: And what makes them ugly to you?
smallfoot:  I... I am the only one. Every other Bigfoot has massive beautiful feet. When hikers in the woods see their footprint, they stop and stare and take photos and molds. 
smallfoot: They're the scariest footprint of them all. A hiker finds my footprint in the woods and they think some human was just walking barefoot. No fear. No photos. Embarrassing.
Kai:  So you want your footprint to be intimidating?
smallfoot:  Of course! How else will anyone know I exist in the woods!
Kai: Well, what if you let the humans find you?
smallfoot:  Find me?
Kai: Yeah, if your footprints are human sized, it would be easier to surprise them, wouldn’t it?
smallfoot: You mean, get up close? No one has done that since they took a video of my uncle.
Kai: Well if no one has seen a bigfoot up close since your uncle, how would they know Bigfoots are all big-footed?
smallfoot:  What are you saying?
Kai: I’m saying you can forge your own path, with your own feet, and not compare yourself to the rest of your family. You might be more terrifying than you think.
smallfoot:  I could sneak up on them...
Kai: Yeah dude, your feet could be a huge help.
smallfoot: I think... I think I should go to the woods and try this out.
Kai:  Yeah, knock yourself out buddy. And maybe stop calling yourself smallfoot?
smallfoot:  Why?
Kai: It feels like it's normalized negative self-talk.
smallfoot:  What about Daryl?
Kai: Terrifying. Formidable.
smallfoot: Thank you
leave smallfoot
