Kai: That is pretty common I would say. When would you say this all started?
mermaid:  I think it has been the past two years. I feel like I’ve just been treading water.
mermaid: Making due with what I have, even though it is not quite right for me.
mermaid:  Have you ever felt like that?
Kai:  I think everyone can feel like that from time to time.
Kai:  When I was going to school for therapy, there were a few times where I felt like I was coming in last place.
It's tough. It makes you question everything, but I made it out to the real world and found success.
